From d062b3f447a5b2e860fa5a2a349ab5ab640351d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 02:43:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD visual selection and yank support so terminal panes
 offer Vim-style copying

Terminal command mode supports character, line, and block selections in both panes and yanks selected text into the UI clipboard. Terminal chat submission uses a raw selected-agent path so slash-prefixed chat text is not confused with provider command execution.
